   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I want to plot a graph with all the dates in x axis.</div><div>Here is the code I used</div><div><br></div><div>```</div><div>library(tidyverse)</div><div>library(readxl)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>data &lt;- readxl::read_excel(&quot;Sentinel-1 Metadata info.xls&quot;)</div><div>centroid &lt;- slice(data,1)</div><div><br></div><div>data %&gt;% </div><div>  ggplot(aes(`Date of acquisition`, `Bperp(m)`)) +</div><div>  geom_point() +</div><div>  geom_segment(aes(x = centroid$`Date of acquisition`, y = centroid$`Bperp(m)`, </div><div>                   xend = `Date of acquisition`, yend = `Bperp(m)`)) +</div><div>  theme_minimal()</div><div>```</div><div>I got the graph like this</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/423c08dcd7a3/Screenshot%20from%202020-04-09%2012-29-38.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2020-04-09 12-29-38.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"198\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>But I want to display all the dates in the format DDMMYYYY.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
