   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Check out the docs for ggplot2::scale_x_date()</div><div><a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_date.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_date.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366227508000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EHL3tA4aBZOUUJ-HpVUvC\">https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_date.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>Should be something like <br><pre><span>base</span> + <span>scale_x_date</span>(<span>date_labels</span> <span>=</span> <span>&quot;%d%m%Y&quot;</span>)</pre></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
